      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not really a programmer or anything, but I feel as though list limits really shouldn't be a thing, period. I know for a fact there are ways to make a computer read from a list file without the number of items being an issue unless it gets to the hundreds of thousands on a single person, which is why I've never understood things like the limit on favorite avatars and the limit on favorite people and worlds. To have an upload limit I can sort of understand for space reasons, but at least up it to like 500. The only person that has to browse through that list is the player.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
