  "details": "It's an bit old bug so do at we can only have 200 Avatar on our account at the time, it is not as bad as most people never reach over 100 but for us some is making avatar to movies and series on VRchat can have problems when our actor must have different unique Avatar more of the same in different stages,\nand what I understand then all has the same bug as well,\nI would be happy if you guy can make the limit a bit higher like 300-400,\nI know it's a lot to ask,\nbut it's a problem that has several months",
